    "source": {
      "value": "tott0"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You're accustomed to the desolate wilds of Belkzen and able to blend into the sparse shadows of craggy rocks and quench your thirst with drops of water. You might be a member of an isolated orc hold, traveling mercenary, or wandering warrior from nearby human settlements.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Survival skill and the Badlands Lore skill. You gain the Forager skill feat."
    },
